WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-Bridge, high above a swirling void, tense.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.300 align:center
Lyra: No... Not this way!

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Futility. Relinquish.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Lyra: Never.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.200 align:center
Echo Shard: The path is gone.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Mid-span of the Crumbling Memory-Bridge, urgent.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.800 align:center
Lyra: There! Kael's shard!

8
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Lost already. Let it fall.

9
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.400 align:center
Lyra: Mine!

10
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.700 align:center
Kael: Hold... close.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Crumbling Memory-Bridge, overlooking the void, desperate.

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.300 align:center
Lyra: It's giving out!

13
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.600 align:center
Echo Shard: The end is here.

14
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.900 align:center
Lyra: Not yet. Never.

15
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.200 align:center
Kael: Falling... again.

16
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void-Current – a swirling river of indistinct memories, dread.

17
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.800 align:center
Lyra: Where... which way?

18
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Embrace the currents.

19
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.400 align:center
Kael: They... consume.

20
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.700 align:center
Lyra: No. I choose.

21
00:00:52.1000 --> 00:00:56.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void-Current, deeper within, tense.

22
00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.300 align:center
Lyra: Kael! What was that?

23
00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.600 align:center
Kael: The path... illusion.

24
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:01.900 align:center
Lyra: Illusions? Everywhere?

25
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.200 align:center
Kael: They... wait.

26
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:09.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Narrow, turbulent channel in the Void-Current, urgent.

27
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.800 align:center
Lyra: Too many... too close!

28
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your defenses weaken.

29
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.400 align:center
Lyra: Not this one. Not yet.

30
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Holding tight. Forgetting why.

31
00:01:18.1000 --> 00:01:23.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void-Current, a momentary lull, dread.

32
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.300 align:center
Lyra: Focus! Remember...

33
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: What purpose remains?

34
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:27.900 align:center
Kael: Don't... listen.

35
00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.200 align:center
Lyra: I know... why.

36
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Exit of the Void-Current / Entrance to a memory-chamber, desperate.

37
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:37.800 align:center
Lyra: Almost there!

38
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: No escape. Only return.

39
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.400 align:center
Lyra: Never return!

40
00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.700 align:center
Kael: Out... but where?

41
00:01:43.1000 --> 00:01:48.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory-Chamber, cornered by a colossal Loom, dread.

42
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.300 align:center
Lyra: Trapped! No...

43
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: This memory is ours.

44
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.900 align:center
Lyra: Not yet. Not mine.

45
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Relinquish. Be absorbed.

46
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory-Chamber, facing the Loom, desperate.

47
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.800 align:center
Lyra: No choice. Not anymore.

48
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.100 align:center
Kael: A cost... so high.

49
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Foolish. You diminish.

50
00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.700 align:center
Lyra: Better diminished... than gone.

51
00:02:10.1000 --> 00:02:16.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Chamber / Edge of a new void, dread.

52
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.300 align:center
Lyra: What... what was that?

53
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.600 align:center
Kael: A piece... gone.

54
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.900 align:center
Lyra: Who... who did I lose?

55
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We know your purpose. We know your name.
